   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "store",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Four ways in, and everything that dies lands here**: a failed identity check, a sanctions hit, a refusal at banding, and a reviewer's refusal.\n\nConfirmed with the desk 2026-08-27. The first two are hard stops — they never reach banding at all.\n\nThis is the audit trail; the letter is what the client receives. Compliance will ask what is retained here and for how long, and nothing in this drawing answers that."
   },
